  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;It has been demonstrated that the existing use of the dwellinghouse (Class C3) as a six (6) person occupancy House of Multiple Occupancy (HMO) (Use Class C4) falls within the tolerances of Class L of Part 3 of Schedule 2 of The Town and Country Planning (General Permitted Development) (England) Order 2015 (as amended) and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;commenced prior to the Borough wide Article 4 direction removing permitted development rights, with the use&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(51, 51, 51);&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;coming into effect before 12 June 2026.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;",
    "The\r\nuse is therefore a lawful development"
  ]
